{"version":1,"content":"<p>埃及國會周一（26日）正式授權軍方向沙特阿拉伯提供軍事支援，以應對親伊朗也門胡塞武裝加劇的襲擊。</p><p>此舉由總統塞西上周提出，標誌着這人口最多的阿拉伯國家更直接地捲入中東局勢，惟埃及官方強調有關軍事支援將嚴格限於防禦性質。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:43:07.431378+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T07:27:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T21:38:11.141120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:38:20.116329+00:00","content_hash":"21378f27a5d0c2d994441271d1c9088be5a44673d3455335332a68c17c356c28","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}